{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》主要演員包括：楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤、鄺潔楹等。</p><p>昨晚（11日）一集亮點，是陳展鵬飾演的何氏公子何家俊首度出場！</p><p>話晒視帝級，又是男主角之一，展鵬出場自然甚有氣勢，在鏡頭前實打實做引體</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:03:50.663085+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:12.042980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:12.042980+00:00","content_hash":"1ac97c3d9c7c9fc68d58c089b61b40f4628649e38fd39a72132a0cb18a9bfe41","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}